{"seq":3,"slug":"fallback-multi-channel","title":"降级与多通道策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/delivery-reliability/fallback-multi-channel","wordCount":1704,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"降级与多通道策略\">降级与多通道策略</h1><p>推送通知的 at-most-once 投递语义意味着：没有任何单一通道能保证 100% 送达。推送不可达的原因多样——Token 失效、设备离线超过 TTL、通知权限被关闭、厂商通道故障、网络不可用。对于关键业务消息（支付结果、安全警告、预约确认），必须建立多通道降级体系，确保消息最终触达用户。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Fallback（降级）</strong>：主通道（推送）失败后，按优先级依次尝试备选通道（短信/邮件/站内信）</li>\n<li><strong>送达确认（ACK）</strong>：客户端收到消息后主动向服务端回报，作为降级触发判断的依据</li>\n<li><strong>多通道路由</strong>：根据消息重要度、用户偏好和通道健康状态动态选择投递通道</li>\n<li><strong>站内信（Message Center）</strong>：应用内消息列表，不依赖外部通道，100% 到达率的兜底方案</li>\n<li><strong>幂等投递</strong>：多通道可能导致重复送达，通过 message_id 做客户端去重</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"多通道投递架构\">多通道投递架构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[消息触发] --&gt; B[Push Orchestrator]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Primary: 推送通知]&#10;    C --&gt; D{送达确认?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[投递成功]&#10;    D --&gt;|否/超时| F[Fallback Router]&#10;    F --&gt; G[SMS 短信]&#10;    F --&gt; H[站内信/消息中心]&#10;    F --&gt; I[邮件]&#10;    F --&gt; J[微信模板消息/公众号]&#10;    F --&gt; K[语音电话&lt;br/&gt;仅极端场景]&#10;    G --&gt; L{送达确认?}&#10;    H --&gt; L&#10;    I --&gt; L&#10;    J --&gt; L&#10;    L --&gt;|是| E&#10;    L --&gt;|否| M[标记为未送达&lt;br/&gt;等待用户回线]\">graph TD\n    A[消息触发] --&gt; B[Push Orchestrator]\n    B --&gt; C[Primary: 推送通知]\n    C --&gt; D{送达确认?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[投递成功]\n    D --&gt;|否/超时| F[Fallback Router]\n    F --&gt; G[SMS 短信]\n    F --&gt; H[站内信/消息中心]\n    F --&gt; I[邮件]\n    F --&gt; J[微信模板消息/公众号]\n    F --&gt; K[语音电话&lt;br/&gt;仅极端场景]\n    G --&gt; L{送达确认?}\n    H --&gt; L\n    I --&gt; L\n    J --&gt; L\n    L --&gt;|是| E\n    L --&gt;|否| M[标记为未送达&lt;br/&gt;等待用户回线]</pre><p>核心决策点：<strong>何时判定推送失败并触发降级</strong>。这取决于消息的时效性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消息类型</th>\n<th>推送等待窗口</th>\n<th>降级通道</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>支付结果</td>\n<td>30 秒</td>\n<td>短信 → 站内信</td>\n<td>用户焦急等待确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证码/OTP</td>\n<td>即刻（不走推送）</td>\n<td>短信为主通道</td>\n<td>推送延迟不可预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全警报</td>\n<td>1 分钟</td>\n<td>短信 + 邮件</td>\n<td>安全事件必须触达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物流更新</td>\n<td>5 分钟</td>\n<td>站内信</td>\n<td>时效性中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>营销活动</td>\n<td>不降级</td>\n<td>仅站内信兜底</td>\n<td>成本不值得多通道投递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预约提醒</td>\n<td>10 分钟</td>\n<td>短信</td>\n<td>错过预约代价高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"送达确认机制设计\">送达确认机制设计</h2><p>判断&quot;推送是否送达&quot;是降级触发的前提。各平台的送达确认能力参差不齐（详见 <a href=\"delivery-optimization\">送达率优化</a>），因此需要在应用层建立独立的确认机制：</p>\n<h3 id=\"客户端-ack-模式\">客户端 ACK 模式</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant S as Server&#10;    participant G as Push Gateway&#10;    participant D as Device&#10;&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;G: 发送推送 (msg_id: abc123)&#10;    G-&gt;&gt;D: 投递通知&#10;    D-&gt;&gt;S: ACK (msg_id: abc123, received_at: ...)&#10;    Note over S: 收到 ACK → 标记已送达&#10;    Note over S: 超时未收到 ACK → 触发降级\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant S as Server\n    participant G as Push Gateway\n    participant D as Device\n\n    S-&gt;&gt;G: 发送推送 (msg_id: abc123)\n    G-&gt;&gt;D: 投递通知\n    D-&gt;&gt;S: ACK (msg_id: abc123, received_at: ...)\n    Note over S: 收到 ACK → 标记已送达\n    Note over S: 超时未收到 ACK → 触发降级</pre><p>ACK 的发送时机：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>通知展示时 ACK</strong>：通过 Notification Service Extension（iOS）或 <code>FirebaseMessagingService.onMessageReceived</code>（Android）在收到消息时立即上报</li>\n<li><strong>通知点击时 ACK</strong>：用户交互后上报（确认用户已看到，但延迟较长）</li>\n<li><strong>App 打开时批量 ACK</strong>：用户打开 app 时将所有未确认的通知 ID 批量上报</li>\n</ul>\n<p>推荐组合使用&quot;展示时 ACK&quot;（触发降级判断）+ &quot;点击时 ACK&quot;（确认用户感知）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通道特性对比\">通道特性对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>送达率</th>\n<th>时延</th>\n<th>成本/条</th>\n<th>富媒体</th>\n<th>用户干扰度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>推送通知</td>\n<td>56-95%</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短信</td>\n<td>95-99%</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>0.03-0.05 元</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邮件</td>\n<td>85-95%（到达率）</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>站内信</td>\n<td>100%（到达）</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>无（需用户主动查看）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微信模板消息</td>\n<td>90%+</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>免费（有频控）</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语音电话</td>\n<td>95%+</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>0.08-0.15 元</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"降级路由决策引擎\">降级路由决策引擎</h2><p>降级路由不是简单的&quot;推送失败就发短信&quot;。需要综合考虑消息重要度、用户偏好、通道状态和成本预算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def route_fallback(message, push_result):&#10;    if push_result.delivered:&#10;        return  # 已送达，无需降级&#10;&#10;    channels = get_fallback_channels(message.priority)&#10;    user_prefs = get_user_channel_preferences(message.user_id)&#10;&#10;    for channel in channels:&#10;        if channel not in user_prefs.blocked_channels:&#10;            if channel.is_healthy() and within_budget(channel, message):&#10;                send_via_channel(channel, message)&#10;                if channel.supports_ack and wait_for_ack(channel, timeout):&#10;                    return  # 降级通道送达成功&#10;&#10;    # 所有通道尝试失败&#10;    enqueue_for_retry_on_user_online(message)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> route_fallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(message, push_result):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> push_result.delivered:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 已送达，无需降级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_fallback_channels(message.priority)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_prefs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_user_channel_preferences(message.user_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channels:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_prefs.blocked_channels:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel.is_healthy() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> within_budget(channel, message):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                send_via_channel(channel, message)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel.supports_ack </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wait_for_ack(channel, timeout):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    return</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 降级通道送达成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 所有通道尝试失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    enqueue_for_retry_on_user_online(message)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"用户通道偏好\">用户通道偏好</h3><p>允许用户设置各类消息的接收通道偏好是降低打扰度的关键：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消息类型</th>\n<th>推送</th>\n<th>短信</th>\n<th>邮件</th>\n<th>站内信</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交易通知</td>\n<td>必开</td>\n<td>用户可选</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全警报</td>\n<td>必开</td>\n<td>必开</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>营销推广</td>\n<td>用户可选</td>\n<td>需用户 opt-in</td>\n<td>用户可选</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社交互动</td>\n<td>用户可选</td>\n<td>关闭</td>\n<td>关闭</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"智能路由与通道健康监控\">智能路由与通道健康监控</h2><p>多通道系统需要实时监控每个通道的健康状态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监控指标</th>\n<th>健康阈值</th>\n<th>不健康处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>送达率</td>\n<td>&gt; 90%</td>\n<td>降低该通道优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均延迟</td>\n<td>&lt; 10s (推送) / &lt; 30s (短信)</td>\n<td>对时效性消息切换通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误率</td>\n<td>&lt; 5%</td>\n<td>暂停使用该通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 可用性</td>\n<td>&gt; 99.5%</td>\n<td>自动切换备用供应商</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>短信通道尤其需要多供应商策略（至少 2-3 家短信服务商），单一供应商故障时秒级切换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"站内信作为兜底通道\">站内信作为兜底通道</h2><p>站内信（In-App Message Center / Inbox）的独特价值在于：它不依赖任何外部通道，100% 到达用户的消息列表——前提是用户打开 app。</p>\n<p>站内信的设计要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>与推送去重：同一事件只展示一条（推送已展示则站内信标记为已读）</li>\n<li>未读计数同步：app icon badge 显示站内信未读数</li>\n<li>消息分类与过期：按类型分 tab，过期消息自动归档</li>\n<li>富媒体支持：支持图片、链接、按钮等交互元素</li>\n</ul>\n<p>站内信是所有降级链路的终极兜底——即使推送、短信都失败，用户下次打开 app 时必然能在消息中心看到。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本控制与-roi\">成本控制与 ROI</h2><p>多通道降级意味着成本上升。需要建立成本模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{total} = N_{push} \\times C_{push} + N_{sms} \\times C_{sms} + N_{email} \\times C_{email} + N_{voice} \\times C_{voice}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中推送成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{push}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 接近 0（平台免费或极低），短信 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{sms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 约 0.03-0.05 元/条。关键是控制降级触发率——通过 <a href=\"token-management-lifecycle\">Token 管理与生命周期</a> 中的 Token 清理降低无效发送，通过 <a href=\"delivery-optimization\">送达率优化</a> 中的 Priority/TTL 配置提升首次推送成功率，从源头减少降级需求。</p>\n<p>实际运营数据参考（2025 中国市场）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>行业平均推送成功率 95.3%（头部服务商聚合通道）</li>\n<li>需要降级到短信的消息比例通常 &lt; 3%</li>\n<li>短信降级带来的额外成本占推送总成本的 15-25%</li>\n<li>关键交易消息的全通道最终送达率可达 99.5%+</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"幂等性与去重\">幂等性与去重</h2><p>多通道投递必须处理重复送达的问题——推送通道在超时后判定失败，但实际上消息可能已经延迟送达。同时短信降级也已发出，用户收到两次。</p>\n<p>解决方案：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>每条消息携带唯一 <code>message_id</code></li>\n<li>客户端对同一 <code>message_id</code> 的通知做去重展示</li>\n<li>推送 ACK 在降级发送前有最后一次检查窗口（check-before-send）</li>\n<li>短信/邮件内容注明&quot;如果您已通过 app 收到此消息，请忽略&quot;</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这种&quot;宁可偶尔重复，不能遗漏关键消息&quot;的策略，在安全和交易场景中是正确的权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多通道降级体系是确保关键消息最终触达用户的工程保障。核心设计点：基于 ACK 的送达确认触发降级判断；按消息重要度选择降级通道和等待窗口；站内信作为终极兜底；幂等设计处理不可避免的重复投递。成本控制的关键在于从源头提升推送成功率——Token 清理和送达优化每降低 1% 的降级触发率，就能节省大量短信成本。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"降级与多通道策略","id":"降级与多通道策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"多通道投递架构","id":"多通道投递架构"},{"level":2,"text":"送达确认机制设计","id":"送达确认机制设计"},{"level":3,"text":"客户端 ACK 模式","id":"客户端-ack-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"通道特性对比","id":"通道特性对比"},{"level":2,"text":"降级路由决策引擎","id":"降级路由决策引擎"},{"level":3,"text":"用户通道偏好","id":"用户通道偏好"},{"level":2,"text":"智能路由与通道健康监控","id":"智能路由与通道健康监控"},{"level":2,"text":"站内信作为兜底通道","id":"站内信作为兜底通道"},{"level":2,"text":"成本控制与 ROI","id":"成本控制与-roi"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等性与去重","id":"幂等性与去重"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Token 管理与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/delivery-reliability/token-management-lifecycle"},"next":{"title":"用户分群与精准推送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/engagement-operations/segmentation-targeting"}}